# Cloud Sync is intentionally disabled in the public 1.0.1 build.
#
# The legacy Supabase protocol used a short deterministic device key, sent
# pairing material to a third-party QR service, and could store playlist or
# Xtream credentials as plaintext. VITE_SUPABASE_URL and
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY are therefore not accepted as a way to enable the
# feature in 1.0.1. See docs/SECURITY_STATUS.md for the public status.
